WEBVTT

00:52.172 --> 00:52.292
Oh!

01:16.575 --> 01:16.595
♪

01:52.013 --> 01:52.073
you

02:21.487 --> 02:28.089
We left the atmosphere, the world was grey The

02:28.149 --> 02:33.491
heavy gravity has finally faded away We were

02:33.551 --> 02:38.313
living in a room with the curtains drawn tight

02:40.194 --> 02:44.095
But out here in the void, there is only the light

02:46.336 --> 02:50.538
The terrestrial sounds are just a buzz in the ear

02:53.569 --> 02:59.496
A static station that we no longer hear The

02:59.616 --> 03:08.766
silence is turning into a song This is the orbit

03:08.786 --> 03:15.546
where we belong And we are singing The true

03:15.606 --> 03:21.908
spectrum A billion stars burning Ultraviolet

03:21.988 --> 03:29.550
and blue Dancing in the dust of a cosmic summer

03:30.691 --> 03:35.992
The nebula Is splitting the dark in two This is

03:36.052 --> 03:38.973
the electric color

03:41.923 --> 03:44.806
The universe waking up for you

04:15.589 --> 04:23.293
They wanted a painted sky A plastic sun A little

04:23.373 --> 04:29.456
radio hint when the day was done But you cannot

04:29.496 --> 04:35.599
capture the burning of a star When you keep the

04:35.859 --> 04:39.321
engine locked inside a jar

04:42.042 --> 04:44.984
Recharging the coordinates they couldn't see

04:48.858 --> 04:54.563
Out here in the quiet of the zero-g

04:54.583 --> 04:58.346
The terrestrial sounds are just a buzz in the

04:58.847 --> 04:59.247
ears

05:01.849 --> 05:07.875
A static station that we no longer hear The

05:07.955 --> 05:13.159
silence is turning into a song

05:19.579 --> 05:27.064
And we are seeing the true spectrum A billion

05:27.124 --> 05:33.389
stars burning ultraviolet and blue Dancing in

05:33.429 --> 05:40.493
the dust of a cosmic summer The nebula is

05:41.474 --> 05:46.257
splitting the dark in two This is the electric

05:46.457 --> 05:46.958
color

05:50.204 --> 05:55.287
The universe waking up for you.

06:24.604 --> 06:26.486
so so

07:02.350 --> 07:05.152
The true spectrum

07:08.574 --> 07:10.535
Ultraviolet and blue

07:14.357 --> 07:16.758
We finally found the color

07:25.904 --> 07:27.005
you.

